        "slc_eac0488baed44deaa61f8fe07a5ffc12209efe2636f921bc703031ff4ddead4f"
      ],
      "text": "The product exposes WezTerm's Lua configuration system so users can customize fonts, themes, shortcuts, and terminal behavior; e.g. window transparency via `config.window_background_opacity` in `~/.config/kaku/kaku.lua`."
    },
