        "slc_ea17d2fe36a3c46391bd1e9599ddecfb8adbea61110c1dd09aeca6da6bbd3560"
      ],
      "text": "The terminal provides documented keyboard shortcuts including Cmd+T (new tab), Cmd+D / Cmd+Shift+D (pane splits), Cmd+, (settings), Cmd+Shift+A / Cmd+L (AI panel and chat), and Cmd+Click to open URLs or file paths."
    },
